 "name_en": "Compliance Formats – Support Preparation (1J2)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Compliance Formats – Support Preparation (1J2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1aa5a3bff0f84c56b5f87ac62f63bb10\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1aa5a3bff0f84c56b5f87ac62f63bb10__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP Document and Reporting Compliance for <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> is SAP’s solution for the fulfillment of real-time and statutory reporting requirements including end-to-end processing of transaction controls, digital link, and online submission requirements. This scope item activates the display and output of the country content for manual submission processes.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1aa5a3bff0f84c56b5f87ac62f63bb10__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">For information on covered process flows, see the following SAP note (list of covered legal obligations by country):</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/2938041</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1aa5a3bff0f84c56b5f87ac62f63bb10__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate and display country-specific outputs for manual submission</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor status in a reporting dashboard</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage multiple reporting phases</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>合规性格式 – 支持准备 (1J2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio1aa5a3bff0f84c56b5f87ac62f63bb10\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1aa5a3bff0f84c56b5f87ac62f63bb10__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP Document and Reporting Compliance for <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 是 SAP 的解决方案，用于满足实时和法定报告要求，包括交易控制的端到端处理、数字链接和在线提交要求。此范围项目激活手动提交流程的国家/地区内容的显示和输出。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1aa5a3bff0f84c56b5f87ac62f63bb10__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">有关涵盖的流程流的信息，请参阅以下 SAP 注释（按国家/地区列出涵盖的法律义务）：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/2938041</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio1aa5a3bff0f84c56b5f87ac62f63bb10__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">生成并显示国家/地区特定的手动提交输出</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在报告仪表盘中监控状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理多个报告阶段</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "name_zh": "合规性格式 – 支持准备 (1J2)",
